/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/4cb12149-1140-450b-b195-316320800a2b/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript_full/00000002.jsonl:75:{"step_index":260,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T14:53:03Z","content":"Yes, I can connect to **`wiki.corp.intranet.local`** and add documents using your API token.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Connection & Authentication Details\n\n* **Service**: Outline Wiki (`https://wiki.corp.intranet.local`)\n* **Network & SSL**: Connected over HTTP/2 with a valid corporate SSL certificate.\n* **Authenticated User**: **Amit SAMY** (`a.samy@outremer-telecom.fr`)\n* **Team**: `Outremer Telecom`\n* **Account Role**: `member`\n* **Core Abilities**: `createDocument: true`, `createAttachment: true`, `read: true`\n\n---\n\n### 2. Available Collections for Adding Docs\n\nYou have access to 13 collections, with **full read/write and document creation** permissions on the following:\n\n| Collection Name | Collection ID | Permissions |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Infra** | `bda1a3da-cc3d-4c5d-92d1-d831dfbe2eae` | `read_write` (`createDocument: true`) |\n| **Projets** | `03d7f507-0722-46bb-ab83-474b42ba6a1c` | `read_write` (`createDocument: true`) |\n| **Reunions** | `88b3687a-4dde-4109-a4f7-4568a5f09ee4` | `read_write` (`createDocument: true`) |\n| **Test_RAG** | `a18d1aba-f621-430f-9a37-4a723d38e16c` | `read_write` (`createDocument: true`) |\n\n*(The remaining collections—Welcome, SECU, NSS, Cybersécurité, BSS, NOC, SI, BE FTTx, Bureautique—are currently in `read-only` mode for this account).*\n\n---\n\n### 3. End-to-End Write Verification\n\n* Tested `POST /api/documents.create` with a temporary draft document: **Success (`200 OK`)**.\n* Cleaned up the test document using `POST /api/documents.delete`: **Success (`200 OK`)**.\n\nWhenever you're ready, let me know which collection and documents you would like to create or publish!","thinking":"Connectivity, authentication, and permissions are verified, indica