arning: Cleanup failed: {del_res}\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"FAILED: {res}\")\n'","Cwd":"/home/koby","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing document creation and cleanup","toolSummary":"Test documents.create and documents.delete"}}]}
