/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/5926885b-6cea-4611-8d5c-ac9d211422ff/.system_generated/tasks/task-27.log:252:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/4cb12149-1140-450b-b195-316320800a2b/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript_full/00000004.jsonl:34:{"step_index":339,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T08:10:29Z","content":"I have retrieved the project specifications from `https://wikitech.intranet.local/index.php/Migration_Qmail`, synthesized the architectural details and flow matrix, and created the formal **LLD (Low-Level Design)** document on **`wiki.corp.intranet.local`** following the corporate **`[Template] LLD`**.\n\n---\n\n### Document Summary\n\n* **Title**: `LLD - Migration Qmail vers Postfix/Dovecot`\n* **Collection**: **Projets** (`03d7f507-0722-46bb-ab83-474b42ba6a1c`)\n* **Document ID**: `e76fbbe9-9f0f-4491-879c-cf68c25b139a`\n* **Status**: **Published**\n* **Direct Link**: [https://wiki.corp.intranet.local/doc/lld-migration-qmail-vers-postfixdovecot-Pl5cbnn5lU](https://wiki.corp.intranet.local/doc/lld-migration-qmail-vers-postfixdovecot-Pl5cbnn5lU)\n\n---\n\n### Structure & Sections Implemented (Corporate LLD Template)\n\n1. **Description**:\n   * Context and business rationale: Outremer Telecom regional legacy Qmail-LDAP footprint across MTQ (`smtp-mtq-1`), GUA (`smtp-gua-1`), GUY (`smtp-guy-1`), and upstream `172.30.37.225`.\n   * Objectives: Unification onto `mtq-mailsrvp-01`, non-divergent read-only direct LDAP authentication, phased rollout.\n   * Software stack: Postfix (MTA), Dovecot (MDA/IMAP/LMTP), Roundcube (Webmail), LDAP, MariaDB/ProxySQL, and PMG (Proxmox Mail Gateway).\n2. **Schéma n1 (physique)**:\n   * Documented as **N/A** (100% virtualized environment on VMware vSphere).\n3. **Schéma n3 (paquet)**:\n   * Interactive **Mermaid network diagram** detailing DMZ frontals (`trp-wextp-fe1`), application zone (`mtq-mailsrvp-01`), security gateway (PMG), and backend authentication/data zones.\n4. **Schéma n4 (transport)**:\n   * Interactive **Mermaid sequence diagram** illustrating end-to-end connection paths for user authentication, submission/sending (Port 587), and incoming delivery via LMTP (Port 24).\n5. **Schéma fonctionnel**:\n   * Functional architecture diagram displaying the relationships between Roundcube, Postfix, Dovecot, passdb/userdb LDAP lookups, and storage.\n6. **Matrice de Câblage**:\n   * Marked as **N/A** (Virtual networking).\n7. **Matrice de Flux**:\n   * Full firewall/network flow matrix including source, destination, ports (443, 587, 143/993, 3306, 389, 25, 24), protocols, and descriptions.\n8. **Intervenants & Organisation**:\n   * Matrix detailing project roles (CDP/Architecte/SYS Lin: Amit SAMY, SECU: Nilesh, BO: Moorshid).\n9. **Liste des Tâches, Jalons & Conditions de Réussite**:\n   * Detailed phase checklist, key milestones (pilot domain `ool.fr`, LDAP relocation before `smtp-mtq-1` decommission, queue backlog investigation), and success criteria.\n10. **Annexes**:\n    * Documented data anomaly resolutions and cross-reference to the operational document in the **Infra** collection."}
