n| **`## Annexes`** | Complementary operational constraints (mail attribute corruption, legacy sentmail formats, Maildir conventions, and link to the Infra migration page). |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Outline Template Association\n\nThe document is also officially linked to the template in Outline's metadata:\n\n* **Linked Template**: **`[Template] LLD`** (`ca2700fd-8b55-4348-936f-8c02aaf0065d`)\n* **Target Collection**: **Projets** (`03d7f507-0722-46bb-ab83-474b42ba6a1c`)\n* **Document URL**: [https://wiki.corp.intranet.local/doc/lld-migration-qmail-vers-postfixdovecot-Pl5cbnn5lU](https://wiki.corp.intranet.local/doc/lld-migration-qmail-vers-postfixdovecot-Pl5cbnn5lU)"}
/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/5926885b-6cea-4611-8d5c-ac9d211422ff/.system_generated/tasks/task-27.log:521:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/5926885b-6cea-4611-8d5c-ac9d211422ff/.system_generated/tasks/task-27.log:221:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/4cb12149-1140-450b-b195-316320800a2b/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript/00000003.jsonl:62:{"step_index":353,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T08:26:21Z","thinking":"Simplification requires identifying and summarizing the core technical concepts for a management audience. This entails removing unnecessary technical jargon while emphasizing the business value and impact. Security aspects need distillation into key threats, mitigation strategies, and the overall security posture in a digestible manner.\n\n\nVisualizing the new infrastructure as simplified diagrams highlights reduced operational costs and increased availability, achieved by decommissioning older servers.  Data protection will be enhanced through encryption (TLS/HTTPS) across all mail protocols, with dedicated read-only service accounts, and preservation of password hashes to prevent forced resets.\n\nSecurity posture will be improved with pre- and post-delivery spam filtering, utilizing SPF, DKIM, DMARC, and rate-limiting.  Network segmentation (DMZ, application zone, backend) will restrict user access to critical data and directories.  A phased, domain-specific migration approach enables immediate rollbacks, ensuring data integrity without disruption.  Finally, hardening will include retiring unpatched servers and enforcing new administrative credentials.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"curl -s -X POST https://wiki.corp.intranet.local/api/documents.info \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Authorization: Bearer ol_api_8rqnwEkj6naMmItaSE8rWwuJiqMrZISmX5RPF3\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"id\\\": \\\"e76fbbe9-9f0f-4491-879c-cf68c25b139a\\\"}' | python3 -c '\\nimport sys, json\\ndoc = json.load(sys.stdin).get(\\\"data\\\", {})\\nprint(\\\"Current Title:\\\", doc.get(\\\"title\\\"))\\nprint(\\\"Current revision:\\\", doc.get(\\\"revision\\\"))\\n'\"","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Checking current LLD doc info\"","toolSummary":"\"Get current LLD document revision\""}}]}
